            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(6) All requests to draw upon the sick leave bank must be accompanied by a physician's statement confirming the cause of the illness or confinement made on a MCCSSE Sick Leave Bank Physician's Confirmation Form, signed by the physician.",
            "block_bbox": [
                155,
